{"id": "EUVD-2026-102356", "enisaUuid": "46c17de9-95ca-3bbe-a1dc-69a2173f416b", "description": "CFITSIO through 4.7.0 contains a heap-based out-of-bounds read vulnerability in the HCOMPRESS tile decoder that allows attackers to read past the compressed tile buffer via input_nnybble in fits_hdecompress.c. Attackers can supply a crafted FITS file with ZCMPTYPE HCOMPRESS_1 declaring oversized tile geometry to crash applications calling fits_read_pix or disclose limited heap memory.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T18:57:22", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T01:15:29", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:L/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:P/VC:L/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@haind-pwn/cfitsio-zdither0-dither-seed-oob-read", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio/blob/d6d27653740864a0483e74cff23c53e34e1dceee/fits_hdecompress.c#L2575-L2633", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio/blob/d6d27653740864a0483e74cff23c53e34e1dceee/imcompress.c#L6310-L6316", "https://github.com/HEASARC/cfitsio", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/cfitsio-through-4.7.0-heap-out-of-bounds-read-via-hcompress-input-nnybble"], "aliases": ["GHSA-98rm-rv63-xf58", "CVE-2026-111125"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.18, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "7eed91b9-d3f7-3eed-b46f-a1128477c44b", "product": {"name": "CFITSIO", "vendor": {"name": "NASA"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.7.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3abfa65f-1f7d-3de9-bc11-0ab85dbf92c5", "vendor": {"name": "HEASARC"}}], "isExploited": false}